  "cn": "第 10 集 · 失手症",
  "novel": "Barney [[lost|lose]] his [[pickup|pickup]] [[ability|ability]] after a woman [[outsmarted|outsmart]] him. He [[froze|freeze]] at the bar, unable to speak. \"I've got the [[yips|yips]],\" he [[admitted|admit]].\n\nTed [[mooched|mooch]] free gym [[passes|pass]] from the front desk. \"It's a [[system|system]],\" he said, [[pretending|pretend]] to be a guest every day.\n\nBarney tried to [[recover|recover]] his [[confidence|confidence]]. He [[approached|approach]] women but [[choked|choke]] every time. \"My [[mouth|mouth]] stops working,\" he [[complained|complain]].\n\nFinally, Barney discovered the [[secret|secret]]: he needed to stop [[caring|care]]. The moment he stopped trying so hard, the words returned. He [[walked|walk]] up to a woman and said hello. She smiled.\n\nThe yips, Barney realized, were caused by overthinking. Sometimes the best strategy was no strategy at all.",
